* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS Vout
C1 VSS X 1p
C2 net2 net1 1p
I1 VDD X DC 1m
M1 Vout net1 VSS VSS nch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 Vout net1 X VDD pch l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RF net1 Vout 1k
RS net0 net2 1k
Vin net0 VSS DC 1
.ends dut
